{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W48", "prepared_on": "2026-11-28", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-11-22 ～ 2026-11-28</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic shares fall below IPO price<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 股價跌破 IPO 發行價</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic's post-IPO slump could put pressure on AI startup valuations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 上市後股價下滑，可能對 AI 新創的估值造成壓力。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/24/anthropic-shares-fall-below-ipo-price-a-worrying-sign-for-ai-startups/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Jensen Huang Is Back as Nvidia CEO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳重返 Nvidia 執行長職位</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia's board reinstated Huang a little more than a week after he resigned amid allegations of multiple affairs, including with a direct report.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">黃仁勳因多起婚外情指控（包含與直屬部下）請辭，一週多後，董事會讓他復職。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/jensen-huang-is-back-as-nvidia-ceo/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> OpenAI fixes GPT-6.2 billing bug, Astra and Sol will hit usage limits faster<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 修正 GPT-6.2 計費錯誤，Astra、Sol 模型將更快用罄限額</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">An earlier bug let most users consume less quota than they should have. With the fix, Astra hits its limit 40% faster and Sol 25% faster than last week.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">先前的錯誤讓多數用戶少扣了配額。修正後，與上週相比 Astra 用完配額的速度快 40%，Sol 快 25%。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180853\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Character.AI's plan to auction off users' private chats challenged by state AGs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Character.AI 擬拍賣用戶私人聊天紀錄，遭各州檢察長反對</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The bankruptcy sale includes sensitive data from more than 21 million U.S. accounts, 2.1 million of them registered to minors. 42 state attorneys general have objected.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">破產拍賣標的含逾 2,100 萬個美國帳號的敏感資料，其中 210 萬個為未成年人帳號。42 州檢察長已聯手提出異議。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/state-ags-fight-character-ais-plan-to-auction-off-users-private-chats/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Amazon and Meta reportedly in talks to lift blockade on AI agent Muse<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳 Amazon 與 Meta 洽談解除對 AI 代理 Muse 的封鎖</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The two companies are discussing a deal that would end a two-month blockade of Muse on Amazon's marketplace.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">雙方正在討論一項協議，可能結束 Amazon 對 Muse 長達兩個月的封鎖。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/amazon-and-meta-reportedly-in-talks-to-lift-blockade-on-ai-agent-muse/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Weekly Security Report: Chinese hackers use AI attack framework Cairn against East Asian universities<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">【資安週報】中國駭客用 AI 攻擊框架 Cairn 鎖定東亞大學</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">An AI agent reportedly found and exploited a zero-day in medical imaging AI software on its own in about 11 minutes.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI 代理僅花約 11 分鐘，就自主發現並利用醫療影像 AI 軟體的零時差漏洞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180857\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> How data centers are driving a US natural-gas boom<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">資料中心如何推動美國天然氣熱潮</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Developers who don't want to wait up to a decade for a grid connection are building their own behind-the-meter gas plants to power the AI boom.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">業者不願等待長達十年的併網審核，紛紛自建電表後端的天然氣電廠，為 AI 熱潮供電。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/11/25/1149836/data-centers-gas-power-plants/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> A New Breed of Chip Runs AI Models Using Waves of Light<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">新型晶片以光波運行 AI 模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">German company Q.ANT is trying to cut the energy needed to run AI models by using light to perform the toughest calculations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">德國公司 Q.ANT 嘗試用光來執行最繁重的運算，以降低運行 AI 模型所需的能源。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/a-new-breed-of-chip-runs-ai-models-using-waves-of-light/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> India's sovereign AI mission adds Chariot-1, a foundation model trained from scratch<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">印度主權 AI 計畫再添成果，Chariot-1 從零訓練、強化多語言能力</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">India's MeitY announced the launch of Chariot-1, built by Chariot Artificial Intelligence under the IndiaAI Mission.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">印度電子資訊科技部宣布，由 Chariot Artificial Intelligence 在 IndiaAI Mission 支持下開發的 Chariot-1 基礎模型正式推出。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180856\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> AI may soon change what it means to be a theoretical physicist<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 可能很快改變理論物理學家的定義</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Frontier AI is already solving problems that once took top physicists a full day.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">前沿 AI 已能解決過去頂尖物理學家要花一整天的問題。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/11/ai-can-do-the-calculations-physicists-are-figuring-out-what-comes-next/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}